<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/xapi-timestamp> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The time at which the event described by a Statement occurred, represented using the timestamp rules defined by xAPI, including ISO 8601 and RFC 3339 formatting." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/xapi-timestamp/versions/1> .
